{"id":"6785ab5b9adf7eb7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-formula-formation.md","title":"Formula Formation Rules","display":"df-formula-formation — Formula Formation Rules","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-formula-formation","aliases":["92-df-formula-formation"],"display":"df-formula-formation — Formula Formation Rules","depends_on":["[[92-df-atomic-formula]]","[[92-df-expression]]","[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 15–17（PDF 32–34）","source_status":"本地 PA 公式闭包"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-formula-formation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-formula-formation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-formation — Formula Formation Rules"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc02207ec79f9d66\" href=\"?note=dc02207ec79f9d66\" title=\"92-df-atomic-formula\">92-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 15–17（PDF 32–34）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 PA 公式闭包"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\)</span> (candidate expression set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\)</span> (atomic-formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc02207ec79f9d66\" href=\"?note=dc02207ec79f9d66\" title=\"92-df-atomic-formula\">92-df-atomic-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}formation} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\subseteq F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in F\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\\bigl((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in F\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\,\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F\\land\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\in F\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}formation} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\subseteq F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in F\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\\bigl((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in F\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\,\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F\\land\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\in F\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>公式由原子公式递归构造</li>\n<li>逻辑连接词：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg, \\land, \\lor, \\to\">\\(\\neg, \\land, \\lor, \\to\\)</span></li>\n<li>量词：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall, \\exists\">\\(\\forall, \\exists\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是形式语言的核心语法规则</li>\n<li>形成规则是递归的（可判定）</li>\n<li>二元连接词形成的公式采用全括号语法；显示时可省略由优先级唯一恢复的外层括号</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本地语言把 ∧、∨、∃ 当原始构造。原书仅以否定、蕴涵和全称造公式，其它联结词须展开；原书最小闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"40c0018b6d45300e\" href=\"?note=40c0018b6d45300e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-formulas\">92-df-smullyan-formulas</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)$ (candidate expression set, see [[92-df-expression]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_G$ (atomic-formula set, see [[92-df-atomic-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable-symbol set, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本地语言把 ∧、∨、∃ 当原始构造。原书仅以否定、蕴涵和全称造公式，其它联结词须展开；原书最小闭包见 [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}formation} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\land\\mathrm{AtFml}_G\\subseteq F\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\\neg\\varphi\\in F\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\\bigl((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in F\\land(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\in F\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\,\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\in F\\land\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\in F\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg, \\land, \\lor, \\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall, \\exists","display":false}],"bytes":1780,"backlinks":[{"id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FormClosed}_G$ (formation-closure predicate, see [[92-df-formula-formation]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-formation]]"}],"outgoing":["dc02207ec79f9d66","c56ec2b54fc34fc6","d666a3e3ee6c8148","40c0018b6d45300e"]}